{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >DEADCAVE \u2014 About This Game</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deep within the dark caves, survival is everything.<br><strong>DEADCAVE</strong> is a fast\u2013paced 2D pixel-art endless shooter where quick reflexes, weapon mastery, and precise sword strikes decide how long you can endure. Waves of enemies grow tougher with every step, forcing you to deflect bullets, grab fallen weapons before they vanish, and unleash devastating ultimate attacks at just the right moment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3999540/extras/e95237d310cfce1e59c8cb5ba0e2a895.poster.avif?t=1756934722\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3999540/extras/e95237d310cfce1e59c8cb5ba0e2a895.apng?t=1756934722\" class=\"bb_img\" width=79 height=79 /></picture></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3999540/extras/ba885d3c6db5d9f4d86c099c332b21c6.poster.avif?t=1756934722\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3999540/extras/ba885d3c6db5d9f4d86c099c332b21c6.webp?t=1756934722\" class=\"bb_img\" width=120 height=80 /></picture></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3999540/extras/aeb294732f5cf00ab129018d39ee91a0.poster.avif?t=1756934722\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3999540/extras/aeb294732f5cf00ab129018d39ee91a0.apng?t=1756934722\" class=\"bb_img\" width=64 height=64 /></picture></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sword Combat</strong> \u2013 Cut down enemies and reflect incoming bullets.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Variety of Weapons</strong> \u2013 Pick up unique weapons dropped by enemies, each lasting for a limited time.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Three Bullet Types</strong> \u2013 Standard shots, piercing bullets, and ricocheting projectiles for dynamic combat.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dash Ability</strong> \u2013 Evade danger, reposition quickly, or close the gap for a strike.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ultimate Attack</strong> \u2013 Wipe out every enemy on screen in one powerful blast.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Endless Challenge</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Enemy Waves</strong> \u2013 Face melee and ranged foes with different attack patterns.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Adjustable Difficulty</strong> \u2013 Tweak the challenge to your skill level.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Leaderboards</strong> \u2013 Compete globally based on kills and difficulty settings.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>DEADCAVE</strong> delivers a raw, skill\u2013based action experience with a dark atmosphere, tight controls, and satisfying combat feedback.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3999540?t=1756934722","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3999540/3f2648efbd6c489edbc2bc8b0696a58d62788de1/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1756934722","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3999540/5d65cd65e42eb6f0fc14bd7e7af31fc6d8d647fb/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1756934722","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3999540/5d65cd65e42eb6f0fc14bd7e7af31fc6d8d647fb/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1756934722","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"des